cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "Thwake Reservoir Remote Sensing Monitor"
abstract: >-
  An independent, satellite-based record of Thwake Dam reservoir (Makueni/Kitui, Kenya):
  reservoir area, level, volume and percentage full from Sentinel-1/2 imagery and pre-dam
  elevation models, with water-quality indicators and regional change, built on Google Earth Engine.
type: software
authors:
